flowchart LR
    A[Open-Meteo API: ERA5] --> B[API client]
    B --> R[Preserved raw JSON and CSV]
    R --> P[Kafka Producer: JSON + run_id]
    P --> K[Real Kafka broker: 1 topic / 1 partition]
    K --> C[Kafka Consumer: count + SHA-256]
    C --> V[Pandera validation]
    V --> Q[Invalid records and failure reasons]
    V --> T[pandas + NumPy cleaning and transformation]
    T --> D[SQLite: primary key + unique city/date]
    D --> I[Load twice: unchanged count and content]
    I --> E[EDA + five figures + evidence-based findings]
    B -. stage counts .-> F[Pipeline verification]
    C -. stage counts .-> F
    V -. valid / invalid .-> F
    T -. cleaned count .-> F
    D -. stored count .-> F
